-- =============================================================================
-- FAMO Unified API — Complete Normalized PostgreSQL Schema (v2.0)
-- Target Engine: PostgreSQL 15+ (UTF-8, UTC timestamps)
-- =============================================================================
-- Architectural Improvements over the Legacy MySQL Dump:
-- 1. All Primary Keys & Foreign Keys unified to `BIGINT` (`GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY`).
-- 2. Proper Foreign Key constraints (`ON DELETE CASCADE` / `ON DELETE SET NULL`) restored across all tables.
-- 3. Fixed `students.supporter_id` from `VARCHAR(256)` (with `'0'` strings) to nullable `BIGINT REFERENCES supporters(id)`.
-- 4. Fixed `users.chat_id` from `VARCHAR(256)` to `BIGINT` matching `telegram_links.chat_id`.
-- 5. Replaced MySQL `ENUM('0','1')` and `TINYINT(1)` inconsistencies with `SMALLINT CHECK (col IN (0, 1))`.
-- 6. Replaced MySQL generated virtual column hacks (`active_student_key`, `open_student_key`) with native PostgreSQL Partial Unique Indexes (`WHERE is_active = 1` / `WHERE ended_at IS NULL`).
-- 7. Removed 13 dead/duplicate legacy tables (`attendance_archive`, `attendance_classes`, `attendance_records`, `attendance_session_students`, `attendance_sessions`, `reports`, `report_attachments`, `report_replies`, `student_staff_assignments`, `bot_sessions`, `bot_ui_state`, `questions`, `shelves`).
-- =============================================================================

SET client_encoding = 'UTF8';
SET TIME ZONE 'UTC';

